geometry.  Just follow the partition conventions as described in 
the OSF documentation.  Some partition sizes are constant and 
some vary with the overall size of the drive.  We even made up a 
Microsoft Excel 5.0 spreadsheet to calculate the numbers for us 
when we had to set up several new drives on our Alpha Model 800 
