>checked for the existance of /dev/ln0, but its not there, or anything else
>that even would remotely match.  Does anyone have any ideas on what I am 
>should use for the device name?  Thanks,

You're probably missing the packetfilter devices in /dev/pf.  Do a 
MAKEDEV pfilt to create them.  You also need to have the packetfilter
code in the kernel - make sure you have the following lines in your
kernel config file (in /sys/conf):

options         PACKETFILTER
pseudo-device   packetfilter


