: how can users still have the abilty to dial in from home and get
: their mail too?

The PC Eudora clients are likely set up to poll popd and copy the mail
to the client machine every few minutes.  If your users want to get
thier mail from a random client on demand, they must turn off 
automatic mail retrieval polling since it usually copies the mail
out of the server and into the client.
