The same problem is in both lib/remopen.c and innd/rc.c:  the comparison
of inet_addr() with (unsigned long)-1 is invalid on a 64-bit machine.  If
you change it to (unsigned int)-1 in both modules, your FQDN configuration
will work just fine.

